y-id "q-13939" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972686/assets/555cdb44522fab12ad67b54042ee4e47a085802df65c2b32a512eace16b92dd4.png)\n\nCalculate the area of the parallelogram in the figure." :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨1,2⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨2,-1⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot (-1)-2\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-5\\,|=5\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-13939/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-13939"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-69941/selection/ae36f031db2e50be55521c1089ba53f85114c90dc4cadf7806953380ac541039" :answer/id #uuid "73784f3f-8dbb-58b2-a8a4-6235e9e92c8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69941/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "91624d7e-1595-5a2b-b442-393f32892c63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69941/selection/a038cf4df09c65d711c1174200281cc22b8be446497e9dc942f4f18d8fa119e2" :answer/id #uuid "5bd7d3e5-de3a-5efe-8ba7-85f0bdfba122" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69941/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "288363b5-106c-5fe1-bbe8-0be9f42e2925" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69941/selection/5ca222eb66ea69f9e952fa65d41f9e3051b86ee62ab020b2b6de38b79a81750a" :answer/id #uuid "b57c5137-0694-57ed-966f-9cf01baa8e4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{5}+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69941/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "fbd12062-2714-502b-83ae-f29acbb4bbb4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-69941/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-69941/selection/ae36f031db2e50be55521c1089ba53f85114c90dc4cadf7806953380ac541039" "q-69941/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-69941/selection/a038cf4df09c65d711c1174200281cc22b8be446497e9dc942f4f18d8fa119e2" "q-69941/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-69941/selection/5ca222eb66ea69f9e952fa65d41f9e3051b86ee62ab020b2b6de38b79a81750a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-69941" :question/id #uuid "f0fcdf56-3d2c-5171-908b-d37d58939a01" :question/math-academy-id "q-69941" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3} \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3} \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 0-\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,0\\,|=0\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-69941/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-69941"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-102760/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "c4ed4b1f-a53a-5acd-8fe0-d61e55fc1483" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102760/selection/c087f5dc559272d193745a4428553203b94404f681d8529e6e619348c0528d10" :answer/id #uuid "5eb3f3ee-d386-5270-bc60-3279ac537607" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102760/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "84a55685-5435-50c0-8d31-7d0052446f98" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102760/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "f50cce15-e4da-54ab-ac52-8ba0f3445d8e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102760/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "ef3c0543-d58c-5f2b-b4bc-7944aac8322b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102760/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d8c3443f-9724-5852-86a4-5aef6f6d6c0c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-102760/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-102760/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-102760/selection/c087f5dc559272d193745a4428553203b94404f681d8529e6e619348c0528d10" "q-102760/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-102760/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-102760/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-102760" :question/id #uuid "fa1b8678-04a2-558c-8809-1cf0a3ac222d" :question/math-academy-id "q-102760" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 1-(-\\frac{3}{2})\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =3-3 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,0\\,|=0\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-102760/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-102760"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-320394/field-1/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" :answer/id #uuid "a7f3f431-4a20-536f-9053-222bd1fc38a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-320394/field-1/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "ddfe5f91-ee8a-5252-8be6-2a9828a470cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-320394/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e8b93417-6775-5f38-8566-f0306993f132" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-320394/field-1/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" :answer-field/choices ["q-320394/field-1/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" "q-320394/field-1/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-320394" :question/id #uuid "168c0e01-fa73-5720-9d05-467e30424e24" :question/math-academy-id "q-320394" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972686/assets/f63cf622acc15681e3815118bbd2a187ea6039a548d4be1773634c0dc450c343.png)\n\nDetermine the area $A$ of the parallelogram in the figure.\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨4,-1⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨-2,-3⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =4\\cdot (-3)-(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =-12-2 \\\\  & =-14\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-14|=14\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-320394/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-320394"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-320550/field-1/3ee1b31380b76296d8afa406dadf54cf58733c9ea566eeb931e4a0960a497c5a" :answer/id #uuid "fc11e97c-2e89-5dd7-89a6-1988b866f302" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{9}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-320550/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8683ae6b-229d-55ef-a297-19782ce2469c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-320550/field-1/3ee1b31380b76296d8afa406dadf54cf58733c9ea566eeb931e4a0960a497c5a" :answer-field/choices ["q-320550/field-1/3ee1b31380b76296d8afa406dadf54cf58733c9ea566eeb931e4a0960a497c5a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-320550" :question/id #uuid "ac022c96-1345-5794-bcb4-16b0c470bf27" :question/math-academy-id "q-320550" :question/problem "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=⟨\\frac{3}{2},-5⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨a,6⟩$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & a \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & a \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot 6-a\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =9+5a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9+5a & =0 \\\\ 5a & =-9 \\\\ a & =-\\frac{9}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-320550/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-320550"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
